 4. 🏎️ Stat du jour: GTA shatters records 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Image : Rockstar Games Grand Theft Auto VI generated $3.79 billion in preorder and Day 1 sales, marking not just the most lucrative video game debut ever, but likely the biggest launch of any creative work in the history of entertainment, Axios' Sara Fischer reports. 

 GTA VI netted more in its debut than the highest-grossing movie ever, "Avengers: Endgame," has earned in its lifetime ($2.9 billion). Keep reading . 

 
 
